# Feature: held effort task (people busy elsewhere). "review" is an effort task for Dev, who is booked on the higher-priority "build" for 01-05..01-07. TaskJuggler holds "review" until Dev is free on 01-08, although its only predecessor allows an earlier start (ADR-0014 "held"). Ann is free and takes "docs" in parallel.
# Binding: review waits three working days for Dev; docs shows the same window with nobody held.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
project held "Held effort" 2026-01-05 - 2026-01-30 {
}

resource dev "Dev"
resource ann "Ann"

task kick "Kickoff" {
  milestone
}

task build "Build" {
  depends kick
  priority 1000
  effort 3d
  allocate dev
}

task review "Review" {
  depends kick
  effort 2d
  allocate dev
}

task docs "Docs" {
  depends kick
  effort 2d
  allocate ann
}
